sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent A (initiator)
    participant B as Agent B (responder)
    Note over A,B: Discovery (A2A Agent Card)
    A->>B: GET Agent Card
    B-->>A: Agent Card: capabilities.extensions lists ANEX v0.2<br/>(purposes, credential formats, jwks_uri, max_rounds)
    alt ANEX supported
        Note over A,B: Activation
        A->>B: A2A message + A2A-Extensions header: engage
        B-->>A: Response echoes A2A-Extensions: engage-response
        Note over A,B: Structured ANEX session (one A2A task)
    else No ANEX agent, or extension not echoed
        Note over A,B: Plain-language fallback
        A->>B: Text or email: AI disclosure, purpose, request, promises
        B-->>A: Human reply, covered by the stated promises
    end
